flowchart TD
  A[Request received] --> B[Normalize request]
  B --> C[Fingerprint request]
  C --> D[Select permanent branches]
  D --> E[Create Dynamic Thought Tree]
  E --> F[Generate up to 3 hypotheses]
  F --> G[Score with evidence, reliability, utility, probability, risk, cost, reversibility, uncertainty, policy]
  G --> H{Core gate}
  H -->|expand| I[Expand best paths]
  H -->|prune| J[Prune weak paths]
  H -->|backtrack| K[Backtrack to last valid node]
  H -->|select| L[Select best verified path]
  H -->|block| M[Fail closed]
  H -->|abstain| N[Return safe abstention]
  I --> G
  J --> G
  K --> G
  L --> O[Core join]
  M --> O
  N --> O
  O --> P[Universal Core verdict]
  P --> Q[Redacted Nyra explanation]
  Q --> R[Optional learning candidate]
  R --> S[Retention cleanup]

